{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a premium responsive Featured Products section inspired by modern luxury fashion and streetwear websites. The layout should feel like a high-end editorial fashion product feed with oversized imagery, clean typography, minimal UI, and smooth modern interactions similar to premium designer brand homepages.
    
    Originally this was a horizontal carousel, but update it so the section is now a vertically scrolling responsive products layout/grid while preserving the same premium aesthetic, hover effects, animations, and image-focused design.
    
    The section should feel like a luxury fashion homepage product feed rather than a standard Shopify collection grid or boxed product cards.
    
    Main Layout Requirements:
    
    Remove horizontal carousel scrolling completely
    Products should display in responsive rows and continue downward vertically
    Users should scroll down the page to view all products
    Maintain smooth responsive scaling across all devices
    Preserve luxury oversized editorial imagery
    Maintain premium spacing and typography
    Ensure fast smooth performance on desktop and mobile
    No horizontal overflow or white-space issues on mobile
    
    MOST IMPORTANT DESIGN CHANGE:
    
    There should NOT really be visible “cards”
    Remove boxed card styling entirely
    No obvious card backgrounds or containers
    The product image itself should essentially BE the card
    The entire layout should feel image-dominant and editorial
    Images should visually blend into the layout naturally
    Minimize unnecessary padding/backgrounds around products
    Focus the design around the imagery itself
    
    Image Requirements:
    
    Product images should always fit and cover the image area cleanly
    Use a cover-style image fit while preserving proper garment visibility
    Prevent awkward cropping of hoodies, pants, or full outfits
    Maintain centered positioning for products
    Images should feel immersive and oversized
    Keep product imagery premium and editorial
    Preserve visible garment detail without over-cropping
    Remove aggressive zooming/cropping behavior
    
    Hover Image Behavior:
    
    On hover, reveal the second product image if available
    Secondary hover image must match the EXACT same:
    scale
    framing
    proportions
    positioning
    crop level
    Prevent the hover image from appearing more zoomed-in than the primary image
    Maintain smooth fade/reveal transitions
    Remove excessive hover zoom effects
    Optional subtle hover movement only
    Hover behavior should feel smooth and luxury-focused
    
    Final Sizing Refinements:
    
    Reduce overall product container/card sizing by approximately 5%
    Increase actual product image sizing inside the layout by approximately 5%
    Reduce dead space beneath images
    Make the products visually dominate the layout more
    Maintain clean premium spacing between products
    Keep proportions balanced and responsive
    
    Product Information:
    
    Product title
    Price
    Compare-at price
    Sale percentage or sale badge
    Optional sold out badge
    Optional quick add to cart
    Optional wishlist icon
    Fully clickable product area
    
    Theme Editor Customization Settings:
    Add highly advanced customization controls directly in the Shopify theme editor.
    
    Collection & Layout Controls:
    
    Collection picker
    Products per row (desktop/tablet/mobile)
    Number of products to show
    Grid spacing
    Row spacing
    Column spacing
    Section max width
    Section padding
    
    Advanced Product Sizing Controls:
    
    Product container scale (%) slider
    Product image scale (%) slider
    Ability to proportionally resize both image and container independently
    Card width slider
    Card height slider
    Image container height
    Product image padding controls
    Max image width controls
    Product image aspect ratio controls
    Image fit mode controls
    Typography scaling controls
    Content spacing controls
    
    Typography Controls:
    
    Product title font size
    Price font size
    Compare-at price font size
    Font weight controls
    Text spacing controls
    Text alignment controls
    
    Color Controls:
    
    Background color
    Title color
    Price color
    Compare-at price color
    Sale badge colors
    Hover overlay colors
    Quick add colors
    
    Optional Feature Toggles:
    
    Show/hide sale badges
    Show/hide compare-at pricing
    Show/hide quick add button
    Show/hide vendor
    Show/hide product ratings
    Enable/disable hover animations
    Enable/disable second-image reveal
    
    Responsive Requirements:
    
    Fully responsive across desktop, tablet, and mobile
    Prevent compressed layouts on smaller screens
    Prevent image cutoff on mobile
    Ensure balanced image scaling on all devices
    Maintain smooth responsive resizing
    Optimize touch performance on mobile
    
    Performance & Technical Requirements:
    
    Shopify Online Store 2.0 compatible
    Use schema settings for all customization
    Highly optimized and lightweight
    Lazy load images
    Use responsive image sizing
    Ensure accessibility support
    Ensure no layout shifting
    Maintain fast Lighthouse/performance scores
    Clean and scalable code structure
    
    Design Direction:
    The final result should feel like a premium luxury fashion/streetwear homepage with immersive oversized product imagery, minimal visible UI, clean typography, smooth hover transitions, and ima, Update the section so that ALL product images load at 3000x3000 resolution for maximum image quality and consistency.
    Critical image behavior requirements:
    
    
    The primary image and secondary hover image must ALWAYS match perfectly in:
    
    
    scale
    
    
    zoom level
    
    
    framing
    
    
    positioning
    
    
    proportions
    
    
    crop level
    
    
    
    
    There should NEVER be a situation where the hover image appears more zoomed-in or more zoomed-out than the primary image
    
    
    Images should NEVER touch the borders/edges of the image area
    
    
    Maintain visible breathing room around the garments at all times
    
    
    Prevent aggressive cropping or over-zooming completely
    
    
    Keep hoodies, pants, and full outfits fully visible and naturally framed
    
    
    Maintain consistent editorial-style framing across all products
    
    
    Responsive layout requirements:
    
    
    Mobile view: each product should take up exactly 50% width (2 products per row)
    
    
    Desktop view: each product should take up exactly 25% width (4 products per row)
    
    
    Maintain perfectly equal sizing across all products and rows
    
    
    Prevent compressed layouts or oversized product scaling on smaller screens
    
    
    Image fit requirements:
    
    
    Use intelligent cover-style fitting while preserving full garment visibility
    
    
    Keep products centered vertically and horizontally
    
    
    Prevent the image from zooming so far that the product touches the container edges
    
    
    Maintain consistent whitespace balance around all products
    
    
    Preserve a premium luxury editorial fashion look across desktop and mobile views.
    
    , there should be no card, and no grey background. The images should fill the entire cover. and the secondary image should do the exact same and NOT be zoomed in on hover. I need the sizing of the product images to be bigger but proportionally. There is too much space on the top of the product image, remove it. My product images already have white space, so you dont need to add white space background as if its transparent., Update the product image rendering and container behavior to achieve perfectly balanced edge-to-edge product imagery without cutoff, excessive zoom, or excessive whitespace.
    
    Image Fit & Framing Requirements:
    
    The product image must fit naturally and proportionally inside its container at all times
    Prevent any part of the clothing/product from being cut off vertically or horizontally
    Prevent over-zoomed imagery where garments touch or exceed the section edges
    Prevent under-scaled imagery with too much empty space around the product
    The image should visually fill the layout in a premium editorial way while still preserving full garment visibility
    The left edge of the product image should align naturally with the left boundary of the product area
    The right edge of the product image should align naturally with the right boundary of the product area
    The image should feel edge-to-edge without aggressive cropping
    Maintain balanced whitespace around hoodies, pants, sleeves, and hems
    Use intelligent responsive image scaling to dynamically balance fit and coverage across all screen sizes
    
    Image Sizing Logic:
    
    Use adaptive object-fit behavior combining contain and soft-cover logic
    Prioritize full product visibility first, then maximize visual coverage second
    Never allow the primary or secondary hover image to render at different scales
    Ensure hover images inherit identical positioning, scale, dimensions, crop behavior, and alignment as the main image
    Remove any hover zoom transform causing image enlargement or cutoff
    Maintain a stable aspect ratio during hover transitions
    Ensure image containers preserve a perfectly centered composition both vertically and horizontally
    
    Responsive Behavior:
    
    Desktop products should feel large and luxurious without touching edges
    Mobile products should remain fully visible without cropping sleeves, hoods, or pants
    Prevent inconsistent scaling between products with different photography framing
    Ensure all products visually occupy a consistent amount of space regardless of garment shape
    
    Visual Goal:
    
    The final layout should resemble premium luxury fashion editorials where the product image itself becomes the layout — clean, balanced, edge-aligned, immersive, and never awkwardly cropped or zoomed.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% liquid
  assign products_to_show = block.settings.products_to_show
  assign collection = block.settings.collection
%}

{% style %}
  .ai-luxury-products-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
    padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding_top }}px {{ block.settings.section_padding_horizontal }}px {{ block.settings.section_padding_bottom }}px;
  }

  .ai-luxury-products__container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: {{ block.settings.section_max_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ai-luxury-products__grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: {{ block.settings.row_spacing }}px {{ block.settings.column_spacing }}px;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .ai-luxury-product-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .ai-luxury-product__link-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .ai-luxury-product__image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: {{ block.settings.image_aspect_ratio }};
    overflow: hidden;
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.content_spacing }}px;
  }

  .ai-luxury-product__image-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .ai-luxury-product__image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: {{ block.settings.image_fit_mode }};
    object-position: center;
    display: block;
    transition: opacity {{ block.settings.hover_transition_speed }}ms ease;
  }

  .ai-luxury-product__image--secondary-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    opacity: 0;
  }

  {% if block.settings.enable_hover_animations %}
    .ai-luxury-product__link-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-luxury-product__image--secondary-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      opacity: 1;
    }

    {% if block.settings.enable_hover_movement %}
      .ai-luxury-product__link-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-luxury-product__image-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
        transform: translateY(-{{ block.settings.hover_movement_distance }}px);
        transition: transform {{ block.settings.hover_transition_speed }}ms ease;
      }
    {% endif %}
  {% endif %}

  .ai-luxury-product__badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: {{ block.settings.badge_position_top }}px;
    left: {{ block.settings.badge_position_left }}px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.sale_badge_bg_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.sale_badge_text_color }};
    padding: {{ block.settings.badge_padding_vertical }}px {{ block.settings.badge_padding_horizontal }}px;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.badge_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.badge_font_weight }};
    text-transform: {{ block.settings.badge_text_transform }};
    z-index: 2;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.badge_border_radius }}px;
  }

  .ai-luxury-product__info-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: {{ block.settings.text_alignment }};
    padding: 0 {{ block.settings.product_info_padding }}px;
  }

  {% if block.settings.show_vendor %}
    .ai-luxury-product__vendor-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.vendor_font_size }}px;
      color: {{ block.settings.vendor_color }};
      margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.vendor_spacing }}px;
      text-transform: {{ block.settings.vendor_text_transform }};
      font-weight: {{ block.settings.vendor_font_weight }};
      letter-spacing: {{ block.settings.vendor_letter_spacing }}px;
    }
  {% endif %}

  .ai-luxury-product__title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.title_font_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.title_color }};
    margin: 0 0 {{ block.settings.title_spacing }}px;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.title_font_weight }};
    line-height: {{ block.settings.title_line_height }};
    letter-spacing: {{ block.settings.title_letter_spacing }}px;
    text-transform: {{ block.settings.title_text_transform }};
  }

  .ai-luxury-product__price-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: {{ block.settings.price_gap }}px;
    {% if block.settings.text_alignment == 'center' %}
      justify-content: center;
    {% elsif block.settings.text_alignment == 'right' %}
      justify-content: flex-end;
    {% else %}
      justify-content: flex-start;
    {% endif %}
  }

  .ai-luxury-product__price-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.price_font_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.price_color }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.price_font_weight }};
  }

  .ai-luxury-product__price--sale-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.sale_price_color }};
  }

  {% if block.settings.show_compare_at_price %}
    .ai-luxury-product__compare-price-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.compare_price_font_size }}px;
      color: {{ block.settings.compare_price_color }};
      text-decoration: line-through;
      opacity: 0.6;
    }
  {% endif %}

  {% if block.settings.show_quick_add %}
    .ai-luxury-product__quick-add-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      margin-top: {{ block.settings.quick_add_spacing }}px;
      opacity: 0;
      transition: opacity {{ block.settings.hover_transition_speed }}ms ease;
    }

    .ai-luxury-product__link-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-luxury-product__quick-add-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      opacity: 1;
    }

    .ai-luxury-product__quick-add-btn-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 100%;
      padding: {{ block.settings.quick_add_padding_vertical }}px {{ block.settings.quick_add_padding_horizontal }}px;
      background-color: {{ block.settings.quick_add_bg_color }};
      color: {{ block.settings.quick_add_text_color }};
      border: {{ block.settings.quick_add_border_width }}px solid {{ block.settings.quick_add_border_color }};
      font-size: {{ block.settings.quick_add_font_size }}px;
      font-weight: {{ block.settings.quick_add_font_weight }};
      text-transform: {{ block.settings.quick_add_text_transform }};
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all {{ block.settings.hover_transition_speed }}ms ease;
      border-radius: {{ block.settings.quick_add_border_radius }}px;
    }

    .ai-luxury-product__quick-add-btn-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
      background-color: {{ block.settings.quick_add_hover_bg_color }};
      color: {{ block.settings.quick_add_hover_text_color }};
      border-color: {{ block.settings.quick_add_hover_border_color }};
    }
  {% endif %}

  .ai-luxury-product__sold-out-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    background-color: {{ block.settings.sold_out_bg_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.sold_out_text_color }};
    padding: {{ block.settings.sold_out_padding_vertical }}px {{ block.settings.sold_out_padding_horizontal }}px;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.sold_out_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.sold_out_font_weight }};
    text-transform: {{ block.settings.sold_out_text_transform }};
    z-index: 3;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.sold_out_border_radius }}px;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
    .ai-luxury-products__grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: {{ block.settings.row_spacing_tablet }}px {{ block.settings.column_spacing_tablet }}px;
    }

    .ai-luxury-product__title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.title_font_size_tablet }}px;
    }

    .ai-luxury-product__price-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.price_font_size_tablet }}px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-luxury-products-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding_top_mobile }}px {{ block.settings.section_padding_horizontal_mobile }}px {{ block.settings.section_padding_bottom_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-luxury-products__grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: {{ block.settings.row_spacing_mobile }}px {{ block.settings.column_spacing_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-luxury-product__title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.title_font_size_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-luxury-product__price-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.price_font_size_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-luxury-product__quick-add-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      opacity: 1;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<luxury-products-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-luxury-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-luxury-products__container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-luxury-products__grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% if collection != blank and collection.products.size > 0 %}
        {% for product in collection.products limit: products_to_show %}
          <div class="ai-luxury-product-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <a href="{{ product.url }}" class="ai-luxury-product__link-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <div class="ai-luxury-product__image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <div class="ai-luxury-product__image-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {% if product.featured_image %}
                    <img
                      src="{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 3000 }}"
                      alt="{{ product.featured_image.alt | escape }}"
                      class="ai-luxury-product__image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                      loading="lazy"
                      width="{{ product.featured_image.width }}"
                      height="{{ product.featured_image.height }}"
                    >
                    {% if block.settings.enable_second_image and product.images[1] %}
                      <img
                        src="{{ product.images[1] | image_url: width: 3000 }}"
                        alt="{{ product.images[1].alt | escape }}"
                        class="ai-luxury-product__image-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-luxury-product__image--secondary-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                        loading="lazy"
                        width="{{ product.images[1].width }}"
                        height="{{ product.images[1].height }}"
                      >
                    {% endif %}
                  {% else %}
                    <div class="ai-luxury-product__placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                      {{ 'product-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
                    </div>
                  {% endif %}
                </div>

                {% if product.available == false %}
                  <div class="ai-luxury-product__sold-out-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                    {{ block.settings.sold_out_text }}
                  </div>
                {% endif %}

                {% if block.settings.show_sale_badge and product.compare_at_price > product.price %}
                  {% assign discount_percentage = product.compare_at_price | minus: product.price | times: 100 | divided_by: product.compare_at_price %}
                  <div class="ai-luxury-product__badge-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                    {% if block.settings.sale_badge_type == 'percentage' %}
                      -{{ discount_percentage }}%
                    {% else %}
                      {{ block.settings.sale_badge_text }}
                    {% endif %}
                  </div>
                {% endif %}
              </div>

              <div class="ai-luxury-product__info-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {% if block.settings.show_vendor and product.vendor %}
                  <div class="ai-luxury-product__vendor-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                    {{ product.vendor }}
                  </div>
                {% endif %}

                <h3 class="ai-luxury-product__title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {{ product.title }}
                </h3>

                <div class="ai-luxury-product__price-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {% if product.compare_at_price > product.price and block.settings.show_compare_at_price %}
                    <span class="ai-luxury-product__compare-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                      {{ product.compare_at_price | money }}
                    </span>
                  {% endif %}
                  <span class="ai-luxury-product__price-{{ ai_gen_id }} {% if product.compare_at_price > product.price %}ai-luxury-product__price--sale-{{ ai_gen_id }}{% endif %}">
                    {{ product.price | money }}
                  </span>
                </div>

                {% if block.settings.show_quick_add and product.available %}
                  <div class="ai-luxury-product__quick-add-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                    <button
                      type="button"
                      class="ai-luxury-product__quick-add-btn-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                      data-product-id="{{ product.id }}"
                    >
                      {{ block.settings.quick_add_text }}
                    </button>
                  </div>
                {% endif %}
              </div>
            </a>
          </div>
        {% endfor %}
      {% else %}
        {% for i in (1..products_to_show) %}
          <div class="ai-luxury-product-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <div class="ai-luxury-product__link-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <div class="ai-luxury-product__image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <div class="ai-luxury-product__image-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {{ 'product-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="ai-luxury-product__info-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <h3 class="ai-luxury-product__title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">Product title</h3>
                <div class="ai-luxury-product__price-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  <span class="ai-luxury-product__price-{{ ai_gen_id }}">$0.00</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        {% endfor %}
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
</luxury-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class LuxuryProducts{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
      }

      connectedCallback() {
        this.setupQuickAdd();
      }

      setupQuickAdd() {
        const quickAddButtons = this.querySelectorAll('.ai-luxury-product__quick-add-btn-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
        
        quickAddButtons.forEach(button => {
          button.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
            e.preventDefault();
            e.stopPropagation();
            
            const productId = button.getAttribute('data-product-id');
            
            if (productId) {
              this.addToCart(productId, button);
            }
          });
        });
      }

      addToCart(productId, button) {
        const originalText = button.textContent;
        button.textContent = '{{ block.settings.quick_add_loading_text }}';
        button.disabled = true;

        fetch('/cart/add.js', {
          method: 'POST',
          headers: {
            'Content-Type': 'application/json',
          },
          body: JSON.stringify({
            id: productId,
            quantity: 1
          })
        })
        .then(response => response.json())
        .then(data => {
          button.textContent = '{{ block.settings.quick_add_success_text }}';
          
          setTimeout(() => {
            button.textContent = originalText;
            button.disabled = false;
          }, 2000);

          if (window.theme && window.theme.cart) {
            window.theme.cart.refresh();
          }
          
          document.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('cart:refresh'));
        })
        .catch(error => {
          button.textContent = originalText;
          button.disabled = false;
          console.error('Error adding to cart:', error);
        });
      }
    }

    customElements.define('luxury-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}', LuxuryProducts{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Luxury featured products",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Collection"
    },
    {
      "type": "collection",
      "id": "collection",
      "label": "Collection"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "products_to_show",
      "min": 2,
      "max": 50,
      "step": 1,
      "label": "Products to show",
      "default": 8
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Section spacing"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "section_max_width",
      "min": 1000,
      "max": 2000,
      "step": 50,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Section max width",
      "default": 1600
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "section_padding_top",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 200,
      "step": 5,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Top padding",
      "default": 0
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "section_padding_bottom",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 200,
      "step": 5,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Bottom padding",
      "default": 60
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "section_padding_horizontal",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 5,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Horizontal padding",
      "default": 20
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "section_padding_top_mobile",
      "min": 0,
